# The control for `sideshift-double-tap.inputs`: the same file with the two
# `l` tokens dropped, so the two scripts are tick-for-tick identical except
# for the gesture itself. Any divergence between the two is the sideshift and
# nothing else - see `sideshift-double-tap.inputs` and
# `docs/ghidra/functions/psp-pulse-usa/input-bindings.md`.
#
# This is what the 2026-08-04 note on the other file called "the same file
# with the two `l` tokens dropped" without committing it; committed here so a
# real capture has a real control to diff against, not just a description of
# one.

# Reach racing speed on the opening straight.
180 cross

# Where the double tap alone lived. Ticks preserved so the two scripts stay
# frame-aligned.
1 cross
3 cross

1 cross

# Hold the line through the window the shift and lockout would have covered.
100 cross
